Track 1: Light Buoy Blues
- Story & Context: In the labyrinthine depths of the forgotten "Arcade Annex," young Marcus discovered an ancient, buzzing light buoy, repurposed by older kids to illegally tap into the city's power grid, and its erratic flicker inspired a riff that felt both mournful and rebellious, sparking a furious jam that almost got them caught by the mall's lone, slow-moving security guard, but they ducked into a service tunnel, "Our current pulls you in, don't fight the undertow."
