Track 2: The Channel's Hum
- Story & Context: Elara, sitting alone amidst the decaying plush seats of the old multiplex cinema within the mall, confessed her deepest fear to Silas – that their music, born from these strange, forgotten spaces, would never resonate beyond the walls, feeling the low, almost infrasonic hum of the abandoned building vibrate through her bones, "Is this just noise, or a signal sent to no one?"
